      "q": "What does a detached house in Halkidiki cost?",
      "a": "Detached houses start at about €200,000 near Thessaloniki; sea-view houses on Kassandra and Sithonia usually start at €500,000."
    },
    {
      "q": "Can a house pay for itself with rentals?",
      "a": "Near the beach, houses let for 16 to 20 weeks a year in Kassandra, the strongest rental market in Halkidiki."
